<title>POLAND: Prochem Q3 net rises to PLN 1.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Prochem Q3 net rises to PLN 1.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prochem SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating				1.76   vs    0.18 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  1.90   vs    1.58</p>
